# The storage gate, not the closure-capture check: the value outlives the intrinsic suspension.
suspend-lowering: in `SuspendCoroutineBlockByRefLikeLiveKt.cfIntrinsicLive`
the local variable
which is byref-like (a `ref struct`, via `System.Span`)
lives across the suspending call to `suspendCoroutine`
(mirrors C# CS4007)
